        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Nyasaye yamulula amataala komuhololookhwe, kho Nyasaye yamwitsulila Aburahamu, narusia Loti hakari mukhukwisibwa olwa yakwisia amataala aka Loti yali namenyangamwo.",
          "type": "text",
